{"license":"DANS Licence","fileAccessRequest":true,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Veteranen Instituut, IPNV, interview 994"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:42021"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Veteranen Instituut"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"ICNV  Nederlands Veteraneninstituut"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Nederlands Veteraneninstituut"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>De geïnterviewde is twee keer uitgezonden naar Nieuw-Guinea. Hij vertelt hier over zijn tweede uitzending. De geïnterviewde beschrijft de bootreis op De Dolfijn en vertelt over een conflict tussen mariniers en officieren. De geïnterviewde gaat in op het vertrek naar Biak en vertelt over de werkzaamheden aan boord en de patrouilles. Het patrouillegebied was begrensd maar de commandant ging hier illegaal overheen. Dit had invloed op de sfeer aan boord. Ze kwamen een Indonesisch oorlogsschip tegen maar kregen geen toestemming om aan te vallen. De geïnterviewde reflecteert op de politieke situatie. De patrouilles vonden plaats in verschillende gebieden. De geïnterviewde praat over de verschillen tussen boven- en onderwaterschepen. Na het overdragen van Nieuw-Guinea aan de VN duurde het een tijd voordat de geïnterviewde weer terug kon keren naar Nederland. Hij betreurt het dat hij geen waardering kreeg voor zijn inzet.<br><br>Met de geïnterviewde zijn twee of meer interviews gehouden. Zie relations.<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Koninklijke Marine"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Onderzeedienst"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"De Dolfijn"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Heenreis"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Leven aan boord"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Gezondheid"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"De Schelde-LIoyd"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Werkzaamheden"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Marine officieren"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Patrouilles"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Illegale acties"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Indonesiers"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Brieven"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Ziektes"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Terugreis"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Rangen en standen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Waardering"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Veteranenactiviteiten"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Politieke discussie"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"VN"}}]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2010-03-05"},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2010-10-21"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2010-03-05"},{"typeName":"series","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"seriesInformation":{"typeName":"seriesInformation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>De collectie van het Interview-project Nederlandse Veteranen (IPNV) bestaat uit meer dan duizend  biografische interviews, die gehouden zijn met veteranen van nagenoeg alle conflicten en militaire missies waar Nederland bij betrokken is geweest.<\/p><p>Van soldaat tot generaal, van hospik tot para, van gevechten op Nederlandse bodem in de Mei-dagen van 1940 tot de slag bij Chora in Afghanistan, alles komt aan bod in deze gevarieerde collectie. De geïnterviewden hebben bijgedragen aan een schat aan informatie voor onder andere beleidsmakers, onderzoekers, media en het geïnteresseerde publiek.<\/p><p>Onderstaand treft u de links naar de metadata van alle interviews. De  interviews zijn om privacyredenen alleen na toestemming van het Veternanen Instituut toegankelijk. Deze toestemming kunt u aanvragen per dataset via tabblad 'Permission\".<\/p><p>In het kader van het project Living Oral History Workbench, zijn een aantal interviews via automatische spraakherkenning geïndexeerd zodat ze doorzoekbaar zijn. Zie de onderstaande link naar Interviews Project Living Oral History Workbench.<\/p>"}}]}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRightsHolder","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Unknown"]},{"typeName":"dansPersonalDataPresent","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"Unknown"},{"typeName":"dansMetadataLanguage","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]}]},"dansRelationMetadata":{"displayName":"Relation Metadata","name":"dansRelationMetadata","fields":[{"typeName":"dansAudience","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D34300"],"expandedvalue":[{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D34300","termName":[{"lang":"nl","value":"Moderne en contemporaine geschiedenis"},{"lang":"en","value":"Modern and contemporary history"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"}]},{"typeName":"dansCollection","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/7e30e380-9e02-4b15-a0af-f35286c3ecec","https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/cfa04ed6-4cd0-4651-80cb-ed4ca8fa14f3","https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/078ae626-cf18-4986-b1c8-883c2ab634fb"],"expandedvalue":[{"@id":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/7e30e380-9e02-4b15-a0af-f35286c3ecec","vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections"},{"@id":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/cfa04ed6-4cd0-4651-80cb-ed4ca8fa14f3","vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections"},{"@id":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/078ae626-cf18-4986-b1c8-883c2ab634fb","termName":{"lang":"nl","value":"Nederlandse Veteranen"},"vocabulary